// Probe twin (2026-08-20, drove the activation_state.md ruling):
// guard at depth 1, NATIVE recursion (`+ i64:0` defeats the tail
// loop). Current interp: [1,1,1,1] — the depth-1 RETAINED instance
// rides its held guard selection at epoch 4 (m bottoms) and
// re-emits. Ruled trace: [1,1,1] + FreshBottom — bottom in, bottom
// out. Contrast class5_probe_tail_depth1.gx: same function modulo a
// no-op, THREE different current traces across execution strategies
// (standing/native/tail), all machinery accident; each twin's jit
// agrees with its own interp, so the differential oracle is blind
// (symmetric-blind-spot genus). Red fixture for the P1 amendment.
{let x = array::iter([i64:1, i64:2, i64:3, i64:0]); let m = x / x / i64:3; let rec f = |n: i64| -> i64 select n {i64:0 => select i64:0 {i64:0 if m == i64:0 => i64:1, _ => i64:2}, _ => f(n - i64:1) + i64:0}; f(x - x + i64:1)}
